    "/about-us/news": {intro:"Housing updates and practical guides from the team behind Housing Condition Claims UK.",heading:"Understand developments affecting rented homes",copy:"Our housing articles explain repair responsibilities, evidence, complaints and changes affecting social tenants in straightforward language. Articles are general information rather than legal advice.",items:["Housing-law and policy updates","Practical evidence guidance","Damp, mould and repair information","Links to individual legal assessment"]},
